{
  "name": "Lucky",
  "type": "ability",
  "img": "icons/svg/ice-aura.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You have inexplicable luck that seems to kick in at just the right moment.</p><ul><li><p>You have <strong>3 luck points</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Whenever you make a check, you can spend <strong>1 luck point</strong> to gain <strong>Advantage</strong> on the check.</p></li><li><p>You can choose to spend one of your <strong>luck points</strong> after you roll the die, but you must do so <em><strong>befor</strong></em><strong>e</strong> the outcome is determined.</p></li><li><p>You regain your expended <strong>luck points</strong> when you finish a <strong>Long Rest</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
